          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I found the Racine work order and confirmed that September entered Pending Close at `2025-09-30T18:00:00`. The supplied records include Oracle’s policy, but the cost-event records are missing from the available extract. I’m checking whether they can be made available before drawing a conclusion about the event and its accounting status.",
