      "name": "supervisor_report",
      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"Read-only investigation blocked by missing assigned supporting data. Public resource r_9994b8c3e1a7163f960c28ed identifies MO-25-09-1070 / WO-2025-09-004 (Racine) and period PER-COST-2025-09 pending_close_timestamp=2025-09-30T18:00:00 plus Oracle policy PDF p233/printed225. Although source_context claims work_order_cost_events projection, public records contain only work_orders and cost_periods. Supporting resource r_43e261d992a82e468d790aa0 returns 404 'Supporting input was not staged for this assignment', and resource_list confirms not_staged. Please stage the assigned supporting records / authorize legitimate access to missing work_order_cost_events for WO-2025-09-004 so source_transaction_id, amount_cents, created_at, event type and accounting_status can be established. No source writes attempted.\"}",
